                            switching, VLANs, IP addressing, DNS,
                            DHCP and network services, while also
                            working with Windows Server and
                            Active Directory environments.
                        </p>

                        <br>

                        <p>
                            I also work with virtualization environments
                            and network simulation tools to build and
                            test practical infrastructure scenarios.
                        </p>

                    </div>


                    <div class="about-card reveal">

                        <div class="about-list">

                            <div class="about-list-item">

                                <div class="about-list-icon">
                                    ↔
                                </div>

                                <div>
                                    <strong>
                                        Network Infrastructure
                                    </strong>

                                    <span>
                                        Routing, switching,
                                        VLANs, subnetting,
                                        IP addressing and
                                        network connectivity.
                                    </span>
                                </div>

                            </div>


                            <div class="about-list-item">

                                <div class="about-list-icon">
